orms, meteor showers, and electromagnetic storms can strike at any moment, turning your orderly farm into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously upgrade your farm and unlock wildly creative devices and powerful enhancements, experimenting with different combinations to create your own unstoppable egg-spitting strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897990/extras/b2f07c7c60222ae7489ec4767a946e33.avif?t=1786974546\" width=999 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897990/extras/2b410ef6bc724673a60f2435deacb06b.poster.avif?t=1786974546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897990/extras/2b410ef6bc724673a60f2435deacb06b.webm?t=1786974546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897990/extras/2b410ef6bc724673a60f2435deacb06b.mp4?t=1786974546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your farm, unlock bizarre machines and powerful upgrades, and discover endless combinations to create your ultimate egg-spitting build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897990/extras/c4444dcdc9c0cdaf6a4b0adfa476b828.avif?t=1786974546\" width=951 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared